  "provenance": [
    {
      "field": "proxy duration, SOA and level policy",
      "source": "Scientific Reports DOI 10.1038/srep18603, Methods Experiment 3 and Supplementary Methods: 22 cm/s and five hand-relative distances. Software duration=(0.93-0.05)/0.22=4 s; SOA=(0.93-distance_m)/0.22. The exact sound-onset origin is unreported. A separate 100-ms tail contains the software tactile cue; digital peak 0.9/inverse-square and right-side hand offset are explicit proxy choices. Native generation sidecars bind actual source, renderer, resources and output hashes."
    },
    {
      "field": "distances",
      "source": "Scientific Reports Experiment 3 reports five distances: 5, 27, 50, 71, and 93 cm."
    },
    {
      "field": "trial count",
      "source": "Methods report 208 trials for Experiment 3 with 16 repetitions."
    },
    {
      "field": "lateralized hand anchor",
      "source": "Manual review records that the hand was placed at shoulder width and the near/far speaker line was hand-relative. The profile encodes this with a positive-x cartesian offset and keeps the exact hand side as an unresolved caveat."
    }
  ],
  "notes": "This manifest audits recreation inside the PPS Toolkit GUI. It distinguishes toolkit-generated recreations of reported parameters from the original authors' exact stimulus set."
